From c7309b5fe30edd7acb8cbae4012f548826ba1722 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: workspace-agent <workspace.vm.agent@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 09:19:10 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 44/51] m3 particles: ground plane collision (collideTerrain)

- particleground.ts: a flat invisible ground at world z = 0. Particles
  with PAR_ flags 0x2 that cross it downwards restart their motion at the
  contact (push-out 0.05) with the WhiteoutFlakes response: normal speed
  x -bounce, tangent x friction when moving; rest below 3 x dt.
- Parser reads bounce and friction (32 and 28 bytes before particleType).
- Per particle: kick (motion clock), rest, bounces, born (spawn origin,
  what tails and pinned quads read).

Known defects:
- spawnOnBounce children and the bounce count that kills are not read.
- Collide-objects (0x4) is not done.
